From: fpvOS developers
Subject: [PATCH] ml-aed: support SC231AI V4L2 controls and variable AE tables

P1 carries 478 exposure entries rather than the reference sensor's 366.
Read and validate the table length from the tuning metadata. Actuate
SC231AI exposure and analogue/digital gain atomically through V4L2.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/ml-aed/gains.h
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only */
+/* SC231AI gain Q10 values, recovered from the P1 sensor control interface. */
